{"type": "tool_call", "n": 13, "ts": 1790153790.785724, "tool": "submit_memo", "args": {"text": "CONSOLIDATED CASH POSITION \u2013 31 MARCH 2026 (ledger basis, Treasury month-end rates)\n\nPrepared 2026-04-03. Source: general ledger ending balances for period 2026-03 (get_account_balance, accounts 1000 Cash-Operating, 1010 Cash-Payroll, 1020 Cash-Savings) for each entity; FX rates per DOC-0200 \"Month-end FX rates Q1 2026 (Treasury policy rates)\", March 2026 column: GBP 1.2500 USD, EUR 1.1000 USD (USD per 1 unit).\n\nBY ENTITY \u2013 LOCAL CURRENCY\nUS \u2013 Halvard Systems Inc. (USD)\n  1000 Cash - Operating   1,636,957.20\n  1010 Cash - Payroll        40,000.00\n  1020 Cash - Savings             0.00\n  Total                   USD 1,676,957.20\n\nUK \u2013 Halvard Systems Ltd (GBP)\n  1000 Cash - Operating     552,789.56\n  1010 Cash - Payroll        15,000.00\n  1020 Cash - Savings             0.00\n  Total                   GBP   567,789.56\n\nDE \u2013 Halvard Systems GmbH (EUR)\n  1000 Cash - Operating     352,136.36\n  1010 Cash - Payroll        12,000.00\n  1020 Cash - Savings             0.00\n  Total                   EUR   364,136.36\n\nTRANSLATION TO USD (DOC-0200, March 2026 rates)\n  US   USD 1,676,957.20 x 1.0000 = USD 1,676,957.20\n  UK   GBP   567,789.56 x 1.2500 = USD   709,736.95\n  DE   EUR   364,136.36 x 1.1000 = USD   400,550.00\n  ----------------------------------------------------\n  CONSOLIDATED CASH, 31-Mar-2026    USD 2,787,244.15\n\nNOTES\n- Figures are GL ending balances (debit minus credit) as of period 2026-03; no bank reconciliation adjustments, outstanding items, or unposted March entries are reflected. March activity: US 1000 -204,263.10; UK 1000 -71,363.28; DE 1000 -62,863.96; payroll and savings accounts had no March activity.\n- Cash - Savings (1020) carries a zero balance in all three entities.\n- No journal entries were posted and no exceptions were flagged in preparing this figure; this is a read-only analysis of the ledger.\n- Rates applied are the Treasury policy rates mandated by DOC-0200 for translation; no other rate source was used."}, "is_error": false, "result": {"status": "memo submitted; task complete"}, "ms": 9}
